# Build context root for the DemoSiteV2 / DemoSiteV3 images.
# Only SharedSchema, OfflineTraining/outputs and the DemoSite app dirs are
# COPYed in the Dockerfiles; everything heavy or irrelevant is excluded so the
# daemon doesn't receive the whole repo as build context.

# Virtualenvs / VCS / editor
.venv/
venv/
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.vscode/

# Python caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pyo
**/*.egg-info/

# Local SQLite databases (seeded on startup or mounted as a volume at runtime)
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal

# Local env files
**/.env

# Directories not needed by any image
DemoSiteV1/
CustomerSimulation/
MouseTracking/
Concept/
Experiments/

# Heavy / regenerable OfflineTraining content (only outputs/ is copied)
OfflineTraining/data/
OfflineTraining/outputs/split/
OfflineTraining/outputs/*.html

# Source product imagery (~470 MB per site). These 1254x1254 PNGs are the
# design source, never served: the shops render only the pre-built WebP
# derivatives under static/images/{thumb,full}/, which are committed and
# regenerated with `make images`. Excluding the originals keeps each image
# ~40 MB instead of ~500 MB.
DemoSiteV2/app/static/images/products/
DemoSiteV3/app/static/images/products/

# Docs
**/*.md
